omy during its intended 6-year mission period. A detailed examination of the proposed INSIST would also explore its scientific and technological implications, including its ability to expand our current understanding of various space-based phenomena, including the formation of cosmic dust, star formation, and the interaction between stars and their surroundings. A comprehensive overview of the proposed INSIST would finally discuss the decision-making process for approving the mission and the expected impact on the future of space-based astronomy. 
